{"html": "<header class=\"spec-title-strip\">\n<div class=\"spec-title-col\">\n<div class=\"spec-family-crumb\">\n            FAMILY 02 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">稠密预测与医学分割：从像素输出到自配置系统</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Dense Segmentation</span>\n</div>\n<h3 class=\"spec-model-title\" id=\"model_088_h_denseunet-title\">H-DenseUNet</h3>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-text lang-zh\">先以 2D DenseUNet 学切片内细节，再将特征堆叠进 3D DenseUNet，并通过 hybrid feature fusion 联合预测。</p>\n<p class=\"spec-thesis-en lang-en\">Extracts intra-slice features via a 2D DenseUNet, stacks them into a 3D DenseUNet, and fuses both via a hybrid feature fusion (HFF) layer.</p>\n</div>\n<div class=\"spec-tensor-col\">\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">INPUT DOMAIN // 输入域</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">高分辨率腹部 CT 体</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">High-resolution volumetric abdominal CT scan</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"tensor-row\">\n<span class=\"tensor-kicker\">OUTPUT TARGET // 输出目标</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val lang-zh\">肝脏/肿瘤 3D 分割概率体</span>\n<span class=\"tensor-val tensor-val-en lang-en\">3D volumetric liver and tumor segmentation probability volume</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n</header><div class=\"model-full-body\">\n<!-- Main Split: Original Figure Plate (Left) + Forward Computation Graph (Right) -->\n<div class=\"spec-blueprint-grid\">\n<section class=\"spec-figure-plate\">\n<div class=\"plate-header\">\n<div class=\"plate-header-left\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">PRIMARY FIGURE // Figure 2 · PDF p.4</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">论文原始架构图</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Original Paper Architecture Diagram</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"plate-header-right\">\n<a class=\"plate-source-link\" href=\"https://doi.org/10.1109/TMI.2018.2845918\" rel=\"noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><span>SOURCE PDF</span><svg class=\"ui-icon-xs\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.7\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M7 17L17 7M9 7h8v8\"></path></svg></a>\n<button class=\"plate-zoom-btn\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_088_h_denseunet')\" type=\"button\"><svg class=\"ui-icon\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" stroke-width=\"1.6\" viewbox=\"0 0 24 24\"><path d=\"M15 3h6v6M9 21H3v-6M21 3l-7 7M3 21l7-7\"></path></svg><span>FULLSCREEN LIGHTBOX</span></button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<figure class=\"arch-figure-box\" onclick=\"openLightbox('architecture_model_088_h_denseunet')\" title=\"Click to open interactive pan &amp; zoom viewer\">\n<img alt=\"H-DenseUNet original paper architecture figure, Figure 2\" class=\"arch-figure-img\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"assets/96879eafd21ccee68ba4.avif\"/>\n<figcaption class=\"plate-caption\">CLICK FIGURE TO OPEN INTERACTIVE PAN &amp; ZOOM VIEWER · Figure 2 · PDF p.4</figcaption>\n</figure>\n</section>\n<aside class=\"spec-circuit-panel\">\n<div class=\"circuit-header\">\n<div>\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">COMPUTATION GRAPH // 8 STAGES</span>\n<h4 class=\"plate-title\">\n<span class=\"lang-zh\">架构前向计算节点拆解</span>\n<span class=\"lang-en\">Forward Pass Computation Nodes</span>\n</h4>\n</div>\n<div class=\"circuit-controls\">\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_088_h_denseunet', -1)\" title=\"Previous Stage\" type=\"button\">◁</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn circuit-play-btn\" data-play-id=\"architecture_model_088_h_denseunet\" onclick=\"toggleAutoPlayNodes('architecture_model_088_h_denseunet')\" title=\"Auto-Trace Computation Graph\" type=\"button\">AUTO</button>\n<button class=\"circuit-btn\" onclick=\"stepArchNode('architecture_model_088_h_denseunet', 1)\" title=\"Next Stage\" type=\"button\">▷</button>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"active-node-spotlight\" id=\"spotlight-architecture_model_088_h_denseunet\">\n<span class=\"spotlight-badge\">\n                STAGE 01 / 08 · <span class=\"lang-zh\">CT 体</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CT</span>\n</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text lang-zh\">按轴位切片供 2D 分支，同时保留 3D 体坐标</span>\n<span class=\"spotlight-text spotlight-text-en lang-en\">Ingests high-resolution volumetric abdominal ct scan and prepares initial tensor representations (CT).</span>\n</div>\n<ol class=\"circuit-timeline\">\n<li class=\"circuit-node active\" data-node-desc=\"按轴位切片供 2D 分支，同时保留 3D 体坐标\" data-node-desc-en=\"Ingests high-resolution volumetric abdominal ct scan and prepares initial tensor representations (CT).\" data-node-idx=\"0\" data-node-name=\"CT 体\" data-node-name-en=\"CT\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_088_h_denseunet', 0)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">01</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">CT 体</span><span class=\"lang-en\">CT</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">按轴位切片供 2D 分支，同时保留 3D 体坐标</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Ingests high-resolution volumetric abdominal ct scan and prepares initial tensor representations (CT).</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"逐切片 dense blocks+U-shaped decoder 提取高分辨率平面纹理\" data-node-desc-en=\"Executes 2D DenseUNet to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.\" data-node-idx=\"1\" data-node-name=\"2D DenseUNet\" data-node-name-en=\"2D DenseUNet\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_088_h_denseunet', 1)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">02</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>2D DenseUNet</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">逐切片 dense blocks+U-shaped decoder 提取高分辨率平面纹理</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Executes 2D DenseUNet to extract primary structural features and establish spatial/sequence encoding.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"切片预测/特征保留细粒度边界与纹理\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 2D prior feature within the core hybrid 2d 3d dense unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"2\" data-node-name=\"2D 先验特征\" data-node-name-en=\"2D prior feature\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_088_h_denseunet', 2)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">03</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">2D 先验特征</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2D prior feature</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">切片预测/特征保留细粒度边界与纹理</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 2D prior feature within the core hybrid 2d 3d dense unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"将对应切片特征重排为与体数据对齐的 3D feature volume\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 2D→3D within the core hybrid 2d 3d dense unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"3\" data-node-name=\"2D→3D 堆叠\" data-node-name-en=\"2D→3D\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_088_h_denseunet', 3)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">04</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">2D→3D 堆叠</span><span class=\"lang-en\">2D→3D</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">将对应切片特征重排为与体数据对齐的 3D feature volume</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 2D→3D within the core hybrid 2d 3d dense unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"在较受控容量下用 3D dense blocks 学跨切片上下文\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs 3D DenseUNet within the core hybrid 2d 3d dense unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"4\" data-node-name=\"3D DenseUNet\" data-node-name-en=\"3D DenseUNet\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_088_h_denseunet', 4)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">05</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>3D DenseUNet</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">在较受控容量下用 3D dense blocks 学跨切片上下文</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs 3D DenseUNet within the core hybrid 2d 3d dense unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"融合 2D intra-slice 与 3D inter-slice 特征并支持联合优化\" data-node-desc-en=\"Performs Hybrid Feature Fusion within the core hybrid 2d 3d dense unet computation pathway.\" data-node-idx=\"5\" data-node-name=\"Hybrid Feature Fusion\" data-node-name-en=\"Hybrid Feature Fusion\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_088_h_denseunet', 5)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">06</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span>Hybrid Feature Fusion</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">融合 2D intra-slice 与 3D inter-slice 特征并支持联合优化</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Performs Hybrid Feature Fusion within the core hybrid 2d 3d dense unet computation pathway.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"1×1×1 卷积映射到肝脏/肿瘤类别 logits\" data-node-desc-en=\"Applies 3D to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.\" data-node-idx=\"6\" data-node-name=\"3D 分割头\" data-node-name-en=\"3D\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_088_h_denseunet', 6)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">07</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">3D 分割头</span><span class=\"lang-en\">3D</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">1×1×1 卷积映射到肝脏/肿瘤类别 logits</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Applies 3D to project aggregated representations toward the target task head.</span></div></li><li class=\"circuit-node\" data-node-desc=\"完整体素级 segmentation mask\" data-node-desc-en=\"Produces 3d volumetric liver and tumor segmentation probability volume via Stage 08.\" data-node-idx=\"7\" data-node-name=\"概率体\" data-node-name-en=\"Stage 08\" onclick=\"selectArchNode('architecture_model_088_h_denseunet', 7)\"><span class=\"circuit-idx\">08</span><div class=\"circuit-body\"><strong class=\"circuit-title\"><span class=\"lang-zh\">概率体</span><span class=\"lang-en\">Stage 08</span></strong><span class=\"circuit-desc lang-zh\">完整体素级 segmentation mask</span><span class=\"circuit-desc circuit-desc-en lang-en\">Produces 3d volumetric liver and tumor segmentation probability volume via Stage 08.</span></div></li>\n</ol>\n</aside>\n</div>\n<!-- Mathematical Formalism Band -->\n<section aria-label=\"H-DenseUNet Mathematical Formalism\" class=\"spec-math-band\">\n<div class=\"math-meta-col\">\n<span class=\"mono-kicker\">MATHEMATICAL FORMALISM</span>\n<div class=\"math-title-text lang-zh\">核心公式 · 2D 切片特征堆叠与 3D 混合融合</div>\n<div class=\"math-title-en lang-en\">Core Formalism · Hybrid 2D Intra-Slice and 3D Inter-Slice Dense Feature Fusion</div>\n</div>\n<div aria-label=\"H-DenseUNet：核心公式 · 2D 切片特征堆叠与 3D 混合融合\" class=\"tex-formula-vector\" role=\"img\">\n<svg aria-hidden=\"true\" data-formula-index=\"88\" focusable=\"false\" height=\"10.722069pt\" preserveaspectratio=\"xMidYMid meet\" style=\"display:block;width:auto;max-width:100%;height:auto;max-height:96px;margin:0 auto\" version=\"1.1\" viewbox=\"-68.642889 -68.976178 326.878882 10.722069\" width=\"326.878882pt\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:xlink=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink\"><defs><path d=\"M3.441641-.992642L3.347448-1.028869C3.079363-.615873 2.98517-.550663 2.65912-.550663H.927432L2.144686-1.825881C2.78954-2.499718 3.072117-3.050381 3.072117-3.615534C3.072117-4.34009 2.485227-4.897998 1.731689-4.897998C1.333183-4.897998 .956414-4.738596 .688328-4.448774C.45647-4.202424 .347787-3.970567 .224612-3.456132L.376769-3.419904C.666591-4.129969 .927432-4.361827 1.427375-4.361827C2.036002-4.361827 2.448999-3.94883 2.448999-3.340203C2.448999-2.775049 2.115703-2.101212 1.507076-1.456357L.217367-.086947V0H3.043135L3.441641-.992642Z\" id=\"m088_g11-50\"></path><path d=\"M3.130082-1.586778C3.130082-1.956301 3.014153-2.296842 2.804032-2.521455C2.65912-2.680857 2.521455-2.767804 2.20265-2.905469C2.702594-3.246011 2.883733-3.514096 2.883733-3.905357C2.883733-4.492247 2.420017-4.897998 1.753425-4.897998C1.39